{"id": "C1737", "verdict": "error", "checks": [{"claim": "muonic r_p 0.8409 fm against the earlier e-p value 0.8775 fm, stated as 4% below", "expr": "1-0.8409/0.8775", "value": 0.04, "tol": 0.25, "unit": "fraction", "computed": 0.0417094, "agrees": true}, {"claim": "Dimensional check of the map: with m_r^3 c^4/(ħc)^2 the result is a mass, not an energy. The standard form is ΔE = (2π/3) Zα ħc |ψ(0)|² <r²> with |ψ(0)|² = (Zα m_r c/ħ)³/(π n³), which gives m_r³c⁶/(ħc)². Dimension counting: c^6 is needed to get an energy.", "expr": "6-4", "value": 2, "tol": 0.01, "unit": "power of c", "computed": 2.0, "agrees": true}], "issue": "The map has m_r^3 c^4/(ħc)^2, which has dimensions of mass rather than energy; it should be m_r^3 c^6/(ħc)^2.", "fix": {"map": "\\Delta E_{\\rm fs}=\\frac{2}{3n^3}(Z\\alpha)^4\\frac{m_r^3c^6}{(\\hbar c)^2}\\langle r_p^2\\rangle\\,\\delta_{\\ell0}"}, "machine": "consistent"}
